{"version":1,"key":"card:503","content":{"id":503,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明变量有三个特点："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"声明提升"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正常情况下，变量需要先声明才能使用，如果在声明之前使用了还未定义的变量，那么会报错，但是在 JavaScript 中，对于使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量，可以在声明之前访问，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量其作用域会提升到其所在作用域的顶部，不过只有声明会被提升，变量的初始化不会提升，因此在初始化之前访问的值是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在初始化之后访问才能获取到值"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"console.log(a); // undefined，在变量 a 定义之前访问，不会报错，访问到的是 undefined\nvar a = 10;\nconsole.log(a); // 10，在定义之后访问，可以访问到初始的值","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"4660a8ff-7a65-4138-addf-00444778c3b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的语句相当于"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"var a; // 声明提升\nconsole.log(a); // undefined\na = 10;\nconsole.log(a); // 10","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"1ba87c3b-d98b-481f-a47f-f47325ac6b07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无块级作用域"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量的作用域是离其最近的"},{"type":"formatted","text":"函数主体","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873"},{"type":"formatted","text":"或"},{"type":"formatted","text":"类静态初始化块","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在除此之外的块作用域中，如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"if","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"for","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"while","code":true},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"try...catch","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"switch","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等块级作用域中声明的变量可以在其外部访问到"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"var a = true;\n\nif (a) {\n    var b = 2;\n}\n\nconsole.log(b); // 2，如果 a 是 false，那么这里访问到的就是 undefined","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"eb260837-b298-4184-88a5-651918029f01","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"function func () {\n  // 变量 a 的作用域在 func 内，因此在函数外无法访问到 a\n  var a = 1;\n}\n\nfunc();\n\nconsole.log(a); // ReferenceError: a is not defined","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ab6ecad0-ad94-4eee-86e0-742ca186a327","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不是在函数或类静态初始化块中使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明变量，分为两种情况："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果在模块中，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的作用域就是整个模块"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果是在脚本中，那么就是全局作用域"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果是全局作用域，声明的变量将作为全局对象的"},{"type":"formatted","text":"不可配置属性","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"（对于浏览器环境，对应于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"windows","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，对于 Node 环境，就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"global","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性）"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"var a = 1;\nconsole.log(window.a); // 1\n\ndelete window.a; // false，不可配置","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"8620f27a-9a2c-4bef-84de-69b286fe75ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重复声明"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在同一个作用域中，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量可重复声明，重新声明后值也不会丢失，除非重新进行了初始化"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"var a = 1;\nconsole.log(a); // 1\n\nvar a;\nconsole.log(a); // 1\n\na = 10;\nconsole.log(a); // 10","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ec6992b5-da19-478d-a4f4-17d874d096b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"function","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在同一作用域声明了同一变量，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 初始化会覆盖 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"function","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"function","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的声明会被提升到作用域的顶部，随后才是变量的初始化"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"var a = 1;\n\nfunction a() {\n    return 2;\n}\n\nconsole.log(a); // 1","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"c5a5c02b-820b-447d-97fd-3caa2fcc11e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/语法/变量声明"],"createTime":1728969197271,"updateTime":1744040305126,"linkedCards":[{"id":505,"target":{"key":"card:505","type":"card","id":505},"summary":"let 声明的变量与其他语言声明的变量特性一致： 在变量声明之前不能使用 console.log(a); // ReferenceError: Cannot access 'a' before initialization let a = ...","tags":["JavaScript/语法/变量声明"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744040305126}}